1
00:00:09,999 --> 00:00:12,575
Hold Tab. Find what's worth stealing.

2
00:00:13,699 --> 00:00:15,771
Then go and get it.

3
00:00:27,599 --> 00:00:30,751
Drink all three... and nothing can catch you.

4
