If it's up there, you can catch it.

5
00:01:01,476 --> 00:01:03,428
Fish. Why not.

6
00:01:07,876 --> 00:01:11,556
Hat. Shades. Chain. The whole sky.

7
00:01:20,276 --> 00:01:22,732
You came here for some fries... right?

